 asmcomp/amd64/emit.mlp             |  6 +++---
 asmcomp/arm64/arch.ml              |  7 ++++---
 asmcomp/arm64/arch.mli             |  3 ++-
 asmcomp/arm64/emit.mlp             | 18 +++++++++---------
